    <!-- HelpActivity -->
    <string name="help_header">Acuɣer ur iteddu ara uṭenṭen?</string>
    <string name="help_description">Ibenkan n Android ɣur-sen askar n uḥraz n tfasa i yessewḥalen asnas ad yeddu deg ugilal neɣ i t-yeswaǧǧen ad yebdu s wudem awurman. Akken ilɣa ad ddun akken iwata, ḍfer isurifen-a:\n\n1. Ḍmen d akken ilɣa ttwasuregen i usnas Birdays (Iɣewwaṛen &gt; Isnasen &gt; Birdays).\n\n2. Ma yella tesbeddeḍ imsefrak n tiwuriwin, imseggamen n tkatut neɣ imseggamen n uḥraz n tfasa (am «Aḥerraz n tbatri», «Clean Master» d wiyaḍ) i yessewḥalen ad yeddu deg ugilal, rnu Birdays ar isurifen.\n\n3. Sens askar n uḥraz n tfasa i Birdays (Iɣewwaṛen &gt; Tbatri &gt; Aseggam n tbatri).</string>
    <string name="help_settings">Ldi iɣewwaṛen</string>
